        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for fans of classic boomer shooters and old-school campaigns, Melted Valor™ delivers fast-paced, no-nonsense single-player action without the grind, frustration, or distractions of modern multiplayer. Just pure, adrenaline-fueled gameplay—nothing fancy, just fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Melted Valor™, the peaceful days of the Green Forces are over. Once guardians of the neighborhood’s harmony, they now find themselves pressed into a brutal conflict against the relentless Tan menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tan have turned to sinister methods—manipulating local bug tribes through toxic chemicals, bending them into weapons of war, and conscripting other toys from across the community: robots, action figures, dolls, all forced into their ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To an outsider, they may look like toys. But to them, this is no game. This is an unforgiving war—one that will decide the future of their world. Every skirmish, every lost comrade, every hard-fought victory carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Green Forces must fight to protect their homes, their friends, and their way of life before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for a desperate struggle across backyards, bedrooms, and beyond… the fate of the neighborhood is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for fans of classic boomer shooters and old-school campaigns, Melted Valor™ delivers fast-paced, no-nonsense single-player action without the grind, frustration, or distractions of modern multiplayer. Just pure, adrenaline-fueled gameplay—nothing fancy, just fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Melted Valor™, the peaceful days of the Green Forces are over. Once guardians of the neighborhood’s harmony, they now find themselves pressed into a brutal conflict against the relentless Tan menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tan have turned to sinister methods—manipulating local bug tribes through toxic chemicals, bending them into weapons of war, and conscripting other toys from across the community: robots, action figures, dolls, all forced into their ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To an outsider, they may look like toys. But to them, this is no game. This is an unforgiving war—one that will decide the future of their world. Every skirmish, every lost comrade, every hard-fought victory carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Green Forces must fight to protect their homes, their friends, and their way of life before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for a desperate struggle across backyards, bedrooms, and beyond… the fate of the neighborhood is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "The Green Forces battle the ruthless Tan menace in a war across the neighborhood. Command toy soldiers, fight bugs turned into chemical weapons, and defend your home in this all-out fight for survival.",
